              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabajabhe abangizingelayo, kepha mina mangingajabhi; mabeme bethukile, kepha mina mangingathuki; wehlisele phezu kwabo usuku olubi, ubabhubhise ngokuchitha kabili.",
          "type": "text",
